{"2981690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tiny Machinery: Lost Reality", "steam_appid": 2981690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981690/extras/193b08859fdff4afc81735dc32e1a793.avif?t=1785756170\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981690/extras_big/193b08859fdff4afc81735dc32e1a793.avif?t=1785756170 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kidnapped by scientists, travel into a virtual dimension to interact with weird 3D machines! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate levers, buttons, and wheels, solve intricate logic riddles, and escape your mental prison</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981690/extras/e35c800894171aa31177ae9b93fa35ba.avif?t=1785756170\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981690/extras_big/e35c800894171aa31177ae9b93fa35ba.avif?t=1785756170 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore weird machines that will impress you with their unique art style </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981690/extras/97667b683cddbdfd81096a4486183436.avif?t=1785756170\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981690/extras_big/97667b683cddbdfd81096a4486183436.avif?t=1785756170 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy tons of original puzzles, interact with buttons, levers, and little wheels to complete each level </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981690/extras/75868cee66ad94c2a592b8578a0a01ff.avif?t=1785756170\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981690/extras_big/75868cee66ad94c2a592b8578a0a01ff.avif?t=1785756170 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game with your headphones to get immersed in the game at best </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981690/extras/8f9c63e546200ac80fcbb981325df055.avif?t=1785756170\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981690/extras_big/8f9c63e546200ac80fcbb981325df055.avif?t=1785756170 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In case you get stuck on a level, click the bulb button to get a hint that will help you solve the riddles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981690/extras/ea6d2e57d1206ea6486ff3738f3a92bc.avif?t=1785756170\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981690/extras_big/ea6d2e57d1206ea6486ff3738f3a92bc.avif?t=1785756170 width=1560 height=234 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will unlock a new story paragraph for each level you complete. Discover how your kidnappers have threatened you and how it ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981690/extras/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785756170\" data-big-src